                        "form": "die Abweichler"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "46385aac-95b0-3e63-a3fe-95d5a71fd446",
                        "entry_id": "8eb42cb6-e090-338e-8754-2ee0abc7abc7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Andersdenkender in einem auf Linientreue ausgerichteten System"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7cf331b-31c3-476a-91ab-2f23f71d9fe6",
                                "sense_id": "46385aac-95b0-3e63-a3fe-95d5a71fd446",
                                "text": "Der Fraktionsvorsitzende ging mit den Abweichlern hart ins Gericht."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8ac76b3-9413-4138-9f15-3a9ff70926fb",
                                "sense_id": "46385aac-95b0-3e63-a3fe-95d5a71fd446",
                                "text": "„Ein wesentlicher Teil der gesetzgeberischen Tätigkeit betraf die Religionspolitik, weil angesichts der vielen Abweichler der Bedarf an Einheitlichkeit besonders groß war.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "310cdc6f-2bdd-4ee1-b87c-1c80c1c6e131",
                                "sense_id": "46385aac-95b0-3e63-a3fe-95d5a71fd446",
                                "text": "„Abweichler haben das Land verlassen oder befinden sich hinter Gittern.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "12af4494-afa5-4ddd-86fa-62736cc4e95e",
                                "sense_id": "46385aac-95b0-3e63-a3fe-95d5a71fd446",
                                "text": "„Man muss bedenken, welche Sanktionen Abweichlern von der Linie des Nationalsozialismus drohten.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09b51722-1d02-4904-96ba-31f73de810e8",
                                "sense_id": "46385aac-95b0-3e63-a3fe-95d5a71fd446",
                                "text": "„Mit seinen Ausführungen gab er die Richtung vor, in die sich die Partei innerhalb kurzer Zeit tatsächlich entwickeln sollte, nämlich zu einer straff geführten, von Konformismus geprägten, undemokratischen Organisation, die von oben kontrolliert wurde und Abweichler bestrafte.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b1247a0d-5b88-45cc-838a-1940a6acc774",
                        "source_entry_id": "8eb42cb6-e090-338e-8754-2ee0abc7abc7",
                        "source_sense_id": "46385aac-95b0-3e63-a3fe-95d5a71fd446",
                        "source_sense_description": "Politik: Andersdenkender in einem auf Linientreue ausgerichteten System",
                        "target_lang_word": "dissenter",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dissenter",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e3f4205-a718-3172-ae90-71ef6787147f",
                                        "entry_id": "717bd32b-0f0b-3777-bca3-f7ae825039ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who dissents (disagrees), especially from an established church."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de4987c6-4b1b-42dc-8497-6f67d421ce1b",
                                                "sense_id": "1e3f4205-a718-3172-ae90-71ef6787147f",
                                                "text": "As my study proceeded, I began to see that an investigation of organizational morality should also explore managerial dissenters, so-called whistleblowers, many of whom take stands against their organizations on grounds that they define as moral."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "42ff27d3-d590-49a3-b085-cd26a39e800a",
                        "source_entry_id": "8eb42cb6-e090-338e-8754-2ee0abc7abc7",
                        "source_sense_id": "46385aac-95b0-3e63-a3fe-95d5a71fd446",
                        "source_sense_description": "Politik: Andersdenkender in einem auf Linientreue ausgerichteten System",
                        "target_lang_word": "deviationist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deviationist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b678e41d-8891-3344-a5fe-b6781f2d3bb6",
                                        "entry_id": "de3e8b6e-de80-3a72-8d7c-a0a875e8a1d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who deviates from accepted beliefs or policies, especially from a prescribed form of Communism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f7c7512-bccb-4bac-a38a-fdfdb9596176",
                                                "sense_id": "b678e41d-8891-3344-a5fe-b6781f2d3bb6",
                                                "text": "The Hsicheng District CCP Committee in Peking Municipality has fully mobilized the masses and led all middle schools in the district to conduct mass debates on the revolution in education, dealing fierce counterblows to the absurd arguments aimed at stirring up the right deviationist wind to reverse previous verdicts in education."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d92b1d6-a487-4dd4-a9ff-f9b273e94874",
                                                "sense_id": "b678e41d-8891-3344-a5fe-b6781f2d3bb6",
                                                "text": "Theirs was the confession, and Mr. Kang turned them out by the dozen throughout his life, expiating one supposed crime after another by denouncing himself as a reactionary element, a deviationist and whatever else was on the political menu that day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13d38b19-3e13-413a-a282-6b8c0dcba5ec",
                                                "sense_id": "b678e41d-8891-3344-a5fe-b6781f2d3bb6",
                                                "text": "For the Italian journalist Enzo Biagi, he recalled the ride in the \"black crow,\" the prison truck in which he was accompanied by other \"deviationists . . . terrorists, Trotskyites, ex-Social Democrats.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c85fdd8a-1719-423d-a254-76140bc080f3",
                        "source_entry_id": "8eb42cb6-e090-338e-8754-2ee0abc7abc7",
                        "source_sense_id": "46385aac-95b0-3e63-a3fe-95d5a71fd446",
                        "source_sense_description": "Politik: Andersdenkender in einem auf Linientreue ausgerichteten System",
                        "target_lang_word": "deviator",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deviator",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c29276d3-b4e0-37cb-919f-f103a88b272a",
                                        "entry_id": "f44915c3-3550-3311-ba4d-fbf5efb26dbf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which deviates, or causes deviation"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18bb232b-d852-482a-b049-af893df278bb",
                                                "sense_id": "c29276d3-b4e0-37cb-919f-f103a88b272a",
                                                "text": "For Tories like Cartland, deviating from the Chamberlain line was seen as betrayal, not disagreement, and the deviators were subjected to raw schoolboy pressure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f02ca000-d63d-47c7-bde2-da594589c38c",
                        "source_entry_id": "8eb42cb6-e090-338e-8754-2ee0abc7abc7",
                        "source_sense_id": "46385aac-95b0-3e63-a3fe-95d5a71fd446",
                        "source_sense_description": "Politik: Andersdenkender in einem auf Linientreue ausgerichteten System",
                        "target_lang_word": "heretic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heretic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82c065d8-97db-391b-9955-26cce3e3c1a7",
                                        "entry_id": "deeaed98-9d85-3219-a347-fe5fb98d95f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone whose beliefs are contrary to the fundamental tenets of a religion they claim to belong to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10e2a57f-7e42-4864-9d15-f259a4b3d1a1",
                                                "sense_id": "82c065d8-97db-391b-9955-26cce3e3c1a7",
                                                "text": "He semeth a sysmatyke\nOr els an heretike,\nFor fayth in hym is faynte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "447af64c-3c35-431a-b341-294c0c74a363",
                                                "sense_id": "82c065d8-97db-391b-9955-26cce3e3c1a7",
                                                "text": "In the framework of traditional medical ethics, the patient deserves humane attention only insofar as he is potentially healthy and is willing to be healthy—just as in the framework of traditional Christian ethics, the heretic deserved humane attention only insofar as he was potentially a true believer and was willing to become one."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f28c41b9-a75d-3e28-9918-9eb928a6caff",
                                        "entry_id": "deeaed98-9d85-3219-a347-fe5fb98d95f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who does not conform to generally accepted beliefs or practices."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "heretic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c0ddeed-a916-37cc-a848-2f073d4b3390",
